cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ZhihuiCAD, please cite it as below."
title: "ZhihuiCAD (智绘CAD): LLM agent for chemical engineering drawings"
abstract: "Open-source LLM-powered CAD agent that generates chemical engineering drawings (pressure vessel drawings, nozzle orientation views, process flow diagrams) and general 2D/3D CAD from natural language, with deterministic geometry and numeric guards."
authors:
  - name: "ZhihuiCAD contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/count110/zhihui-cad"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - LLM
  - CAD
  - text-to-CAD
  - chemical engineering
  - pressure vessel
  - process flow diagram
  - P&ID
  - DXF
  - MCP
  - AI agent
